218
00:13:10,407 --> 00:13:12,034
O quê?

219
00:13:12,108 --> 00:13:14,599
Se te chamarem de "Butterfly," pagarem
um drinque, repetirem esse poema,

220
00:13:14,678 --> 00:13:15,667
